  "short_description": "《勇者小隊全滅了。》是一款劇情驅動的Roguelite遊戲。作為救援隊最後的倖存者，你需要從全滅的勇者小隊中選擇並救出一名成員，與其一同逃離被詛咒的地牢。在歸途中，你將逐漸瞭解他們的過去，並幫助他們面對各自的缺陷。四位勇者，四段不同的故事。",
  "short_description_en": "A story-driven roguelite RPG about a journey through the depths with a broken hero — and what they have to answer for. The hero's party has been annihilated: you carry one of them out of a cursed dungeon, learn what broke them, and settle it together. Four routes, four heroes, four reckonings.",
